        {
          "type": "starrailexpress:role_skill",
          "parameters": {
            "label": "ponder.starrailexpress.label.skill",
            "lines": [
              {
                "en_us": "Erase: aim at a player and release; there is a 1.25 second wind-up (1 second during a blackout), the target gains Slowness IV, and the target must be within 14 blocks in your line of sight when it ends; cooldown 45 seconds, at most 2 charges, recovering 1 charge every 60 seconds. On success one random item of yours is deleted; with no items you suffer a backlash.",
                "zh_cn": "抹除：瞄准玩家释放，期间有 1.25 秒前摇（停电时 1 秒），目标获得缓慢 IV，结束时目标须在视线 14 格内；冷却 45 秒，最多 2 次，每 60 秒恢复 1 次。成功则随机删除自己一件物品，无物品则受到反噬。",
                "zh_tw": "抹除：瞄準玩家釋放，期間有 1.25 秒前搖（停電時 1 秒），目標獲得緩慢 IV，結束時目標須在視線 14 格內；冷卻 45 秒，最多 2 次，每 60 秒恢復 1 次。成功則隨機刪除自己一件物品，無物品則受到反噬。"
              },
              {
                "en_us": "Self erase: after selecting it with the skill switch key, release it within 0.5 seconds of being hit by a player. Once per match, the blast deletes players and dropped items within 4 blocks and kills you (it cannot be released when your death is forced).",
                "zh_cn": "抹除自身：切换技能选中后，在被玩家命中后的 0.5 秒内释放。每局一次，自爆删除半径 4 格内的玩家和掉落物，并使自己死亡(强制死亡时无法释放技能)。",
                "zh_tw": "抹除自身：切換技能選中後，在被玩家命中後的 0.5 秒內釋放。每局一次，自爆刪除半徑 4 格內的玩家和掉落物，並使自己死亡(強制死亡時無法釋放技能)。"
              }
            ]
          },
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
